---
---
<section class="framework-section who-were-for-section" id="who-were-for">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header premium-reveal" style="margin-bottom: 40px;">
      <h2 class="section-title"><span style="color: #141D24;">For buyers who expect </span><span style="color: #7d442a;">more from their property search.</span></h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">More clarity. More independent thinking. More confidence in the decision.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Cards Scroll Track Area (Strictly inside page margins) -->
    <div class="who-portfolio-wrapper premium-reveal">
      <div class="who-cards-track" id="whoCardsTrack" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Who We're For Portfolio Cards">
        <!-- CARD 01: The Busy Executive (Default Expanded) -->
        <article class="who-card is-expanded" data-index="1">
          <div class="who-card-media">
            <img src="style-guide/assets/who_card_01_executive.webp?v=20260910_penthouse_v1" alt="Senior corporate executive in luxury Bengaluru penthouse study overlooking skyline - Acre&Key" width="896" height="1200" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            <div class="who-card-gradient"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="who-card-inner">
            <div class="who-card-bottom">
              <div class="who-buyer-tag">01. THE BUSY EXECUTIVE</div>
              <h3 class="who-card-headline">You know what you want. You just don't have the time to find it.</h3>
              <p class="who-card-copy">For founders, CXOs and senior professionals seeking a better home across Whitefield, Indiranagar and ORR, without the endless sales conversations.<span class="who-card-takeaway">We handle the search and diligence. You focus on the decision.</span></p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- CARD 02: The Family Buyer -->
        <article class="who-card" data-index="2">
          <div class="who-card-media">
            <img src="style-guide/assets/card_you.webp?v=20260904_balcony_fam_v1" alt="Family evaluating residential apartment options in Bangalore with home buyer concierge" width="800" height="386" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            <div class="who-card-gradient"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="who-card-inner">
            <div class="who-card-bottom">
              <div class="who-buyer-tag">02. THE FAMILY BUYER</div>
              <h3 class="who-card-headline">A home that works for everyone.</h3>
              <p class="who-card-copy">For families upgrading across Koramangala, Sarjapur and North Bengaluru, balancing schools, commutes, privacy and how the family actually lives.<span class="who-card-takeaway">We evaluate the home and neighbourhood as one decision.</span></p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- CARD 03: The Thoughtful Buyer -->
        <article class="who-card" data-index="3">
          <div class="who-card-media">
            <img src="style-guide/assets/who_card_03_v2.webp?v=20260910_qc_v1" alt="Thoughtful home buyer reviewing property due diligence and developer track record" width="1376" height="768" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            <div class="who-card-gradient"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="who-card-inner">
            <div class="who-card-bottom">
              <div class="who-buyer-tag">03. THE THOUGHTFUL BUYER</div>
              <h3 class="who-card-headline">You want an honest opinion, not another sales pitch.</h3>
              <p class="who-card-copy">For buyers who want to understand the numbers, plans, specifications and trade-offs before committing significant capital to a home.<span class="who-card-takeaway">If something doesn't stand up to scrutiny, we tell you.</span></p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- CARD 04: The NRI Buyer -->
        <article class="who-card" data-index="4">
          <div class="who-card-media">
            <img src="style-guide/assets/who_card_04_v2.webp?v=20260910_qc_v1" alt="NRI home buyer consulting on Bangalore residential property purchase from abroad" width="1376" height="768" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            <div class="who-card-gradient"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="who-card-inner">
            <div class="who-card-bottom">
              <div class="who-buyer-tag">04. THE NRI BUYER</div>
              <h3 class="who-card-headline">Buying from afar, with someone you can trust on the ground.</h3>
              <p class="who-card-copy">For global Indians in the US, Gulf and Singapore buying prime Bengaluru homes without relying on remote sales conversations or guesswork.<span class="who-card-takeaway">Independent local oversight from shortlisting through handover.</span></p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- CARD 05: The Investor -->
        <article class="who-card" data-index="5">
          <div class="who-card-media">
            <img src="style-guide/assets/who_card_05_v2.webp?v=20260910_qc_v1" alt="HNI residential real estate investor evaluating rental yield and capital appreciation in Bangalore" width="1376" height="768" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            <div class="who-card-gradient"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="who-card-inner">
            <div class="who-card-bottom">
              <div class="who-buyer-tag">05. THE INVESTOR</div>
              <h3 class="who-card-headline">You want the numbers to make sense before you commit.</h3>
              <p class="who-card-copy">For HNI buyers evaluating Bengaluru's growth corridors through entry valuation, future supply, rental demand and eventual resale liquidity.<span class="who-card-takeaway">We test the investment case, not just the appreciation story.</span></p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>